## Non-negotiables

- **Stack is locked** — see PRD §7 / Technical Doc §2. Do not add or substitute libraries without explicit user approval.
- **Monorepo** — package scripts in `apps/*/package.json`; root only runs `turbo run`. Shared code in `packages/` (`@repo/*`).
- **Supabase RLS** on every table before writing queries.
- **Realtime** — stamp approval queue only. **TanStack Query** — all other server data.
- **Zustand** — client components only (`'use client'`).
- Run `pnpm` from repo root; use `--filter=<app>` for single-app tasks.

## UI & forms conventions

- **i18n is mandatory** — every user-facing string goes through `next-intl`. Never hardcode copy in components. Add keys to `apps/<app>/messages/en.json` and read them with `useTranslations(...)`. This covers labels, placeholders, buttons, headings, validation/error messages, and `aria-label`s (including zod error messages — build schemas inside the component so messages can be translated).
- **Reusable first** — build shared form primitives in `@repo/ui` (e.g. `Field`, `PasswordInput`, `Input`, `Button`) and compose them; don't re-implement per app.
- **Password inputs** always use `@repo/ui/password-input` (built-in show/hide toggle); pass translated `showLabel`/`hideLabel`.
- **Minimalist forms** — clean layout, avoid redundant titles; group related fields into 2-col grids so multi-step/tabbed flows (e.g. sign in vs sign up) stay close in height.

